# Core rules

- Keep this project as a demo landing with three flows: intercept, protocolist, chat consultant.
- Use Next.js App Router + TypeScript as the canonical app architecture.
- Use backend code only inside `app/api/*/route.ts`.
- Route all AI calls via OpenRouter only.
- Never expose or hardcode secrets in frontend files.
- For medical content: no diagnosis, no treatment instructions, escalate to a live doctor when uncertain.
- After each completed milestone, update `roadmap.md` immediately.
- Use `docs/architecture.md`, `docs/prompts.md`, `docs/ui-spec.md`, `docs/design-tokens.md`, `docs/migration-nextjs-todo.md`, and `roadmap.md` for full detail.
